---
// apps/main-site/src/components/EthicsSection.astro
---
<section class="py-12 px-4 md:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-[2rem] p-8 md:p-12">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-6 uppercase tracking-tight">
          Code of Ethics
        </h2>
        <div class="prose prose-slate lg:prose-lg text-slate-700 space-y-4">
          <p>
            Maintaining integrity and high ethical and legal standards requires commitment and hard work from all agency personnel. Each employee must accept responsibility for compliance with this code.
          </p>
          <p>
            The core standards and values detailed must be upheld for every employee and in all interactions with the individuals that we serve, our colleagues, and the community.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="/documents/code-of-ethics.pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-blue-700 font-bold hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors group">
            <span>Click HERE to view the full code</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>